ediSys Corp announces a new Windows board game.

Ewords is a fast-paced, challenging, Scrabble-like board game that's fun 
for all ages. Test you skills against the computer or up to three 
opponents across a network. 

Ewords includes seven word board variations, or you can create you own 
version.  You can also change the look of you games with a choice of 
colorful tile patterns.  

Ewords offers 20 different computer opponents with increasingly 
sophisticated vocabulary and skill, ranging from beginner to expert 
levels, with a dictionary of  160,000 words.  On-line help, "best play," 
anagram finders, and word finders are also included.

Whether you match wits against your PC or other players, Ewords spells 
out PC entertainment of the best kind!

Trial Versions of eWords are available to download from the ediSys web 
site at (http://www.ewords.com).



